Work is finished today.
I walk to MG Road.
It is very hot outside.
I enter a big clothes shop.
This is a big shop.
There are many clothes here.
A saleswoman comes to me.
She asks.
"What do you want?"
I say.
"I need cotton clothes."
I need good cotton clothes to wear at the office.
Because of the heat, cotton clothes are good.
The saleswoman says.
"Okay, come with me."
We go to the cotton section.
I look around.
There is a good selection in the cotton section.
There are clothes for adults and kids here.
I like this big shop.
